CWEs: CWE-798 (Use of Hard-coded Credentials) - Low Confidence, CWE-22 (Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory ('Path Traversal')) - Medium Confidence, CWE-200 (Information Exposure) - Medium Confidence

