   - The regular expression used (`re.search('FlashCopy Mapping, id \[([0-9]+)\], successfully created', out)`) assumes the output format of the CLI command will always be exactly as expected.
   - If the command's output changes (e.g., due to a software update), this function may fail or incorrectly process data.

