The `get_max_task_id_for_project` function directly inserts the `project_id` into the SQL query string using string formatting without any sanitization or parameterization. 
An attacker could potentially manipulate the `project_id` input to inject malicious SQL code, leading to unauthorized data access or other harmful actions.

