**CWEs:** CWE-190 (Integer Overflow or Wraparound) - High Confidence, CWE-125 (Out-of-bounds Read/Write) - Medium Confidence, CWE-789 (Uncontrolled Memory Allocation) - High Confidence, CWE-835 (Infinite Loop or Runaway Loop) - Low Confidence

</analysis>

