CWEs: CWE-190 (Integer Overflow or Wraparound) - High Confidence, CWE-400 (Uncontrolled Resource Consumption) - High Confidence, CWE-789 (Uncontrolled Memory Allocations) - Medium Confidence, CWE-775 (Missing Release of File Descriptor or Handle after Effective Lifetime) - Medium Confidence, CWE-399 (Resource Management Errors) - Medium Confidence

