CWEs: CWE-190 (Integer Overflow or Wraparound) - Medium Confidence, CWE-703 (Improper Check or Handling of Exceptional Conditions) - Medium Confidence, CWE-789 (Uncontrolled Memory Allocation) - Medium Confidence

