CWEs: CWE-120 (Buffer Copy Without Checking Size of Input ('Classic Buffer Overflow')) - High Confidence, CWE-789 (Uncontrolled Memory Allocation) - Moderate Confidence, CWE-190 (Integer Overflow or Wraparound) - Medium Confidence

