It's also worth noting that the code doesn't seem to use parameterized queries consistently across all the database interactions, which could expose other parts of the code to SQL Injection attacks. To mitigate these vulnerabilities, it is highly recommended to use parametrized queries or prepared statements whenever possible and ensure proper error handling for network failures.
